==Battleground==
*5 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Rei (Enemy)|Rei]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Rei (Enemy)|Rei]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Rei (Enemy)|Rei]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Titi Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Olga (Enemy)|Olgas]] spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**3 [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuus]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**6 [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichis]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Very easy stage. Bring [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]]. Stall the first few enemies with Eraser, then once the Reis come start spamming your meatshields, saving up for Bahamut. After that, just spam meatshields and Paris until it's over.

